ties\n\nFire Safety System\n\nSecurity\n\nClubhouse\n\nSecurity Guards\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n24x7 Security\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\nDg Backup\n\nLounge Area\n\nDeck\n\nCab Pickup And Dropoff Point\n\nBalcony\n\nDesigner Bathroom Tiles\n\nGlass Partitions In Bathrooms\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\nBrochure Page 1\n\n1of2\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most prestigious and luxurious residential areas, known for sea-view living and exclusive neighbourhood standards. It features high-end apartments, iconic mansions, and secure, private surroundings. With limited inventory and elite demand, property values here continually rise over time. The locality blends tranquillity with proximity to major South Mumbai business areas, making it a prized lifestyle and investment destination.\n\n## Maps","score":0.9073207,"raw_content":null,"id":"5d639a-00"},{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KDsBCAXdxd8","title":"Lodha Malabar Hills | South Mumbai | Sea View | Project Overview","content":"🟢 Lodha Malabar Hills Mumbai is an exceptional residential elevation offering a unique blend of peaceful living and urban convenience\n\n🟢 Lodha Malabar Hills Address Lodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006\n\n|| Amenities ||\n\n🏏Cricket Box \n\n🧗 Wall Climbing\n\n🏊‍♂️ Swimming Pool\n\n🏋️‍♀️ Gymnasium\n\n🏡 Clubhouse\n\n🌳 Landscaped Gardens\n\n🧘‍♂️ Yoga and Meditation Area\n\n🏃‍♂️ Jogging Track\n\n🎉 Multipurpose Hall\n\n🎮 Indoor Games Room\n\n🧑‍ Kids' Play Area\n\n🦳 Senior Citizen Zone\n\n|| Connectivity ||\n\n🛕 Shree Babulnath Mandir - 3 min\n\n🏖️ Girgaon Chowpatty - 5 min\n\n🏡 Hanging Garden - 9 min\n\n🚉 Charni Road Railway Station - 7 min\n\n🛣️ Coastal Road - 8 min [...] Download E-Brochure:  \nDownload Price Sheet:  \n\nLodha Malabar Hills is a luxurious residential project developed by Lodha Group which is located in Malabar Hills, Mumbai. Lodha Malabar is an ultra-luxury residential development, rising 31 floors high, designed with exclusivity in mind by offering just one apartment per floor. Lodha Malabar Hills has uniquely designed floor plans and layouts to ensure ease and convenience for its residents. The property in Malabar Hills is located in a prime location and equipped with numerous amenities. Making it perfect for those who want a convenient and well-connected environment. [...] पूल जो ओशन को भी ओवरलुक करता है। यह स्पेशली उन लोगों के लिए डिजाइन किया गया है जो कंफर्ट और ग्रंजर दोनों चाहते हैं। यह डेवलपमेंट प्रॉमिस करता है प्राइवेसी, प्रेस्टीज और सीमलेस लग्जरी। लोधामालाबार एक अल्ट्रा लग्जरियस रेजिडेंशियल प्रोजेक्ट है जिसके अंदर आपको देखने को मिलेगा 31 स्टोरी का हाई राइज़ टावर जो आपको ऑफर करेगा हर फ्लोर पर सिर्फ एक अपार्टमेंट। यह प्रोजेक्ट इंश्योर करता है अनमैच्ड प्राइवेसी पैनारोमिक व्यू और हर रेजिडेंस के लिए एक ग्रैंड सेंस ऑफ स्पेस। पोजीशन ऑफ़ दिस प्रोजेक्ट इज़ एक्सपेक्टेड बाय दिसंबर 2026। आल्सो इन दिस प्रोजेक्ट यू गेट मॉडर्न अमिनिटी सच एस जिम, वॉकिंग साइकिलिंग ट्रैक्स, आउटडोर लैब, स्विमिंग पूल, स्टेटिंग रिंग एंड इनडोर गेम्स एरिया। आल्सो यू गेट ग्रेट कनेक्टिविटी एस वेल सच एस श्री बाबुलनाथ मंदिर इज़ जस्ट 3 मिनट्स अवे। गिरगांव चौपाटी इज़ जस्ट 5 मिनट्स अवे। हैंगिंग गार्डन","score":0.90289277,"raw_content":null,"id":"c4afc8-01"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/lodha-seamont-facilities-malabar-hill-south-mumbai-npxid-r293999","title":"Lodha Seamont Amenities - Malabar Hill, Mumbai - 99acres.com","content":"Lodha Seamont, Malabar Hill, Mumbai South comes with a comprehensive set of working amenities such as swimming pool, gym, children's play area, car parking,","score":0.8703443,"raw_content":null,"id":"615e46-02"},{"url":"https://propertycloud.in/properties/explore/lodha-malabar-south-mumbai","title":"Lodha Malabar South Mumbai | Book 4 & 5 BHK wirh Flexible ...","content":"Residents will enjoy top-notch Lodha Malabar amenities, including a grand clubhouse, infinity-edge swimming pool, wellness and fitness zones, landscaped gardens, private lounges, dedicated concierge services, and high-level security, ensuring an exclusive and comfortable lifestyle.\n\nIn terms of Lodha Malabar connectivity, the project is strategically located in South Mumbai, with seamless access to Marine Drive, Nariman Point, Worli, and Bandra-Worli Sea Link. It is well-connected to leading business hubs, luxury retail, top educational institutions, and premium healthcare centers, making it an ideal choice for those seeking luxury with convenience.\n\nLodha Malabar Hills Project Amenities\n\n Swimming Pool\n Indoor Games\n Gym\n Jogging Track\n Kids Play area\n Senior Citizen Zone [...] Location Location Map\n\n Location Map\n\nLodha Malabar is strategically located in the prestigious Malabar Hill locality of South Mumbai, along Walkeshwar Road, PIN 400006. Known as one of the most exclusive and sought-after residential areas in India, Malabar Hill offers residents a serene living experience amidst lush greenery and breathtaking views of the Arabian Sea. The project enjoys seamless connectivity to prominent landmarks such as Hanging Gardens, Babulnath Temple, Breach Candy, and Marine Drive. Essential lifestyle amenities including reputed schools, top-class hospitals, premium shopping destinations, and elite clubs are all within close reach, making it an ideal address for luxury living in South Mumbai.\n\n-Charni Road Railwayb Station : 5 min [...] Lodha Malabar Hills Project Connrctivity\n\n Shree Babulnath Mandir - 3 min\n Girgaon Chowpatty - 5 min\n Hanging Garden - 9 min\n Charni Road Railway Station - 7 min\n\nLodha Malabar Hills Project Carpet area\n\n4 & 5 BHK - 9500 sq.ft\n\nLodha Malabar Hills Project Specification\n\nThe positive reviews of Lodha Malabar Hills stem from its strategic location, spacious apartments, world-class amenities, and connectivity to important destinations.\n\nLodha Malabar Hills Mumbai stands out as a remarkable residential development that combines the tranquility of peaceful living with the ease of urban convenience.\n\n Lodha Malabar Hills Address: Lodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006","score":0.86713725,"raw_content":null,"id":"040a0f-03"},{"url":"https://www.guptasen.com/properties/lodha-malabar-palaces-by-the-sea-malabar-hill-south-mumbai","title":"Lodha Malabar Palaces by the Sea - Mumbai - Gupta & Sen","content":"Lodha Malabar is the Best Highrise Residential Tower in Malabar Hill South Mumbai ... Amenities. Infinity Swimming Pool. Clubhouse. Concierge. Private theatre.","score":0.86108357,"raw_content":null,"id":"d75388-04"},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/lodha-group/lodha-malabar-149580","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai | 4 BHK Ultra Luxury Apartments | Houssed","content":"## Floor Plans & Pricing of Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n4 BHK Flat in Lodha Malabar in Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Image 868263\n\n4 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n3826 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n49 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n Security Systems.\n Superior Indoor Air Quality.\n Strategic Location.\n Admirable Design.\n Secured Environment.\n Network Connectivity.\n\n## Amenities Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n 24X7 Water Supply\n Lift\n Security\n Visitor Parking\n Mud Playing Zone\n Recycle Zone\n Children Playing Zone\n Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n Dth And Broadband Connection\n Senior Citizens Walking Track\n Society Office\n Convenience Store\n Relaxation Zone\n Drop-Off Zone [...] Marble flooring\n Laminate finish doors\n Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n Vitrified tile flooring\n Stainless steel sink\n Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n False Ceiling\n TV Point\n Telephone point\n Concealed Plumbing\n Wall-hung WC & shower\n Multi-stranded cables\n Acrylic Emulsion Paint\n Concealed Drainage System\n Geyser Point\n Laminated Flush Doors\n\n## Google Map Location of Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill\n\n## Locality Overview of Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nMalabar Hill is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Malabar Hill region. [...] ### Strategic Infrastructure Developments\n\n Mumbai Coastal Road improving east-west connectivity\n Enhanced road networks connecting South Mumbai to Worli and Bandra\n Upgraded public spaces and heritage conservation initiatives\n\n### Micro-Local Happenings That Influence Value\n\nSouth Mumbai continues to evolve socially, with:\n\n Premium cafés and fine-dining restaurants\n Private members’ clubs and lounges\n Cultural venues and curated social spaces\n\n### Lifestyle Amenities Within the Project\n\n Private pools and wellness zones\n Fully equipped fitness clubs\n Spa, sauna, and relaxation lounges\n Landscaped gardens and social spaces\n\n## 4. Notable Landmarks","score":0.84707206,"raw_content":null,"id":"67a1b9-05"},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-malabar/208302/project","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai - Price on Request","content":"## Amenities & Specifications of Lodha Malabar\n\nLuxury at Lodha Malabar extends beyond the residences into a carefully curated collection of lifestyle experiences. Rather than offering a conventional clubhouse, the development introduces Club Saint Amand, an exclusive private members' club where hospitality, wellness, leisure, and social experiences come together in an intimate setting. Complementing this is a dedicated hospitality team that delivers personalized services inspired by the standards of leading luxury hotels.\n\n### Wellness & Recreation\n\n Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant\n Private Wellness Facilities\n Leisure Spaces\n Relaxation Zones [...] Positioned on the iconic Walkeshwar Road, Lodha Malabar introduces a limited collection of ultra-luxury residences overlooking both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Inspired by Mumbai's celebrated Art Deco heritage, the development combines timeless architecture with expansive sea-facing homes, curated hospitality, and one of South Mumbai's most distinguished residential addresses. Located at Malabar Hill Mumbai, the development enjoys uninterrupted sea and garden views while offering residents access to Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant, including the exclusive Club Saint Amand and personalised hospitality services. The project is registered [...] Positioned on the iconic Walkeshwar Road, Lodha Malabar introduces a limited collection of ultra-luxury residences overlooking both the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Inspired by Mumbai's celebrated Art Deco heritage, the development combines timeless architecture with expansive sea-facing homes, curated hospitality, and one of South Mumbai's most distinguished residential addresses. Located at Malabar Hill Mumbai, the development enjoys uninterrupted sea and garden views while offering residents access to Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant, including the exclusive Club Saint Amand and personalised hospitality services. The project is registered","score":0.838376,"raw_content":null,"id":"b7ddf3-06"},{"url":"https://propertybutler.in/insights/lodha-malabar-malabar-hill-complete-review-2026","title":"Prices, Configurations, Sea vs Garden View & Who Should Buy","content":"## Lodha Malabar Amenities\n\n Infinity pool: High-floor level pool with sea views — among the most photographed amenity in Mumbai luxury residential\n Private lift lobbies: Upper floors have private lobby-to-residence access\n Clubhouse: Resident-only with low resident-to-amenity ratio\n Gymnasium: Fully-equipped, professional-grade\n Concierge: 24x7 hotel-style concierge and valet\n Spa: Treatment rooms, sauna, steam\n Basement parking: 2–3 designated spots per unit\n Security: Multi-tier access control, 24x7 manned security, biometric entry\n Generator backup: 100% common area and apartment generator backup\n\n## Lodha Malabar vs Lodha Seamont vs Kalpataru Prive — How to Choose [...] Garden-Facing Units (East)\n\n Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park ridge view\n Sunrise view from bedroom\n PSF: 15–20% below sea-facing equivalent\n Lower thermal load — east morning sun only\n No sea spray concern\n Value proposition for buyers who prioritise livability over pure sea view\n\nProperty Butler's assessment: for buyers staying under Rs 35 Cr, the garden-facing 3–4 BHK at Lodha Malabar delivers extraordinary quality of living at a meaningful discount. The Hanging Gardens view is unique to Mumbai — no other luxury building looks over this park from a comparable elevation. It is not a consolation prize; it is a different but equally prestigious prospect.\n\n## Lodha Malabar Amenities [...] Project Snapshot — Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill\n\nDeveloper: Lodha Group in association with Malabar Hill Trust | Location: Ridge Road, Malabar Hill, Mumbai 400006 | Status: Delivered — OC received | Configurations: 3 BHK to 6 BHK | Height: Approximately 40 storeys | Facing: Sea-facing (Arabian Sea) and Garden-facing | Primary market: Closed — secondary resale only\n\n## Why Lodha Malabar Is Different From Every Other Lodha Project on the Hill","score":0.76385427,"raw_content":null,"id":"09be6b-07"}],"response_time":2.0,"request_id":"b0713f70-513c-4a5c-aba0-bdf900f44989"}